1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,319
You feel a giant sneeze coming...

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:06,380
so you pinch your nose, shut your mouth, and hold it in.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,406
Big... mistake.

4
00:00:08,426 --> 00:00:12,346
You see, a sneeze blasts air out of your lungs super fast.

5
00:00:12,366 --> 00:00:15,130
With nowhere to go, it gets trapped inside you,

6
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:18,530
and the pressure in your airways jumps about twenty times higher.

7
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:21,675
That air shoots up the tiny tubes to your ears,

8
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,510
and can burst your eardrums,

9
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,980
or pop the blood vessels in your eyes.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,148
But, in rare cases...

11
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,430
it can even tear a hole in your throat.

12
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:32,480
So next time you feel one coming,

13
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,880
just let it out.

14
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:34,770
[sneezes]
